Ladybird defines the CSS property accessors as enumerable prototype
properties. Gecko’s gen_style_properties_webidl and WebKit’s
GenerateCSSStylePropertiesPropertyNames generate IDL attributes.
Blink’s CSSStyleDeclaration::NamedPropertyEnumerator supplies the
enumerated property names.

Chrome 158.0.8127.37, Firefox 151.0, and WebKit 26.5 enumerated
color and marginLeft. Firefox and WebKit also enumerated margin-left
and the prefixed dashed form. Chrome accepted those names for
reads but omitted them from enumeration. Ladybird follows the CSSOM
IDL rules for both forms.
